  "title": "Avocado and Spring Onion Dip",
  "blurb": "A simple, chunky dip that takes minutes to make. Creamy avocado mixed with fresh spring onion and coriander, seasoned with salt and pepper.",
  "steps": [
    "Cut the avocados in half, remove the stones, and scoop the flesh into a bowl.",
    "Trim and finely slice the spring onions, then add them to the bowl.",
    "Roughly chop the coriander and add it to the avocado mixture.",
    "Add the salt and black pepper, then mash everything together with a fork until you reach your preferred texture, keeping it fairly chunky.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning if needed, then serve immediately."
